+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/CASI> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasUpperBoundaryDefinition> "Overlain unconformably locally by pebbly limestone and sandstone of the Upper Cretaceous Strathaird Limestone Formation (STRL) (Sykes, 1975, p. 71)."@en .
