+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DUNSH> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasUpperBoundaryDefinition> "Overlain by the Dunans Clay Member (DUNCL)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/FLOS> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasUpperBoundaryDefinition> "At Kildorais, Trotternish, the Flodigarry Shale Member is seen to be overlain by Paleocene palagonite tuff (Morton and Hudson, 1995)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/GVIN> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasUpperBoundaryDefinition> "Overlain by the Digg Siltstone Member (DIGS)."@en .
