+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/TCN> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasUpperBoundaryDefinition> "Overlain by the Scaladal Sandstone Member (SCSA)."@en .
