+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DIGS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Oxfordian Age (Jurassic Period) (161.5-154.8 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DUNCL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Callovian Age - to - Oxfordian Age (Jurassic Period) (165.3-154.8 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DUNSH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Callovian Age (Jurassic Period) (165.3-161.5 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/FLOS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mudstone and siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Oxfordian Age - to - Kimmeridgian Age (Jurassic Period) (161.5-149.2 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/GVIN> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Oxfordian Age (Jurassic Period) (161.5-154.8 Ma BP)."@en .
